# Scriptable requests for REST Client or translate directly to curl.
# Supply real values through secure local environment settings; never commit them.
@base = https://STAGING_WORKER_HOST
@schoolCode = FICTIONAL_SCHOOL_CODE
@loginId = ISSUED_LOGIN_ID
@password = ENVIRONMENT_SECRET
@csrf = TOKEN_RETURNED_BY_LOGIN
@version = EXAM_VERSION_UUID
@writer = PER_TAB_RANDOM_UUID
@attempt = ATTEMPT_UUID
@question = QUESTION_UUID

### Health; not proof of a full workflow
GET {{base}}/healthz

### Explicit school sign-in (cookie jar managed by the HTTP client)
POST {{base}}/v1/auth/login
Origin: https://APPROVED_FRONTEND_ORIGIN
Content-Type: application/json

{"schoolCode":"{{schoolCode}}","loginId":"{{loginId}}","password":"{{password}}"}

### Session resume
GET {{base}}/v1/auth/session

### Student start/resume, with a stable per-tab writer UUID
POST {{base}}/v1/attempts/start
Origin: https://APPROVED_FRONTEND_ORIGIN
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"versionId":"{{version}}","writer":"{{writer}}"}

### Versioned acknowledged save; response uses stable option ID, not displayed letter
POST {{base}}/v1/attempts/answers
Origin: https://APPROVED_FRONTEND_ORIGIN
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"attemptId":"{{attempt}}","questionId":"{{question}}","writer":"{{writer}}","revision":1,"response":null}

### Idempotent finalization
POST {{base}}/v1/attempts/submit
Origin: https://APPROVED_FRONTEND_ORIGIN
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"attemptId":"{{attempt}}","writer":"{{writer}}"}

### Teacher review (hundredths of a mark)
POST {{base}}/v1/grades/review
Origin: https://APPROVED_FRONTEND_ORIGIN
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"attemptId":"{{attempt}}","questionId":"{{question}}","score":300,"revision":1,"feedback":"Reviewed feedback","reason":"Teacher review"}

### Teacher publication requires all questions reviewed
POST {{base}}/v1/results/publish
Origin: https://APPROVED_FRONTEND_ORIGIN
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"attemptId":"{{attempt}}","reason":"Teacher publication"}

### Published-only student progress
POST {{base}}/v1/reports/student
Origin: https://APPROVED_FRONTEND_ORIGIN
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Class-scoped school report (administrator/assigned teacher)
POST {{base}}/v1/reports/school
Origin: https://APPROVED_FRONTEND_ORIGIN
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"academicYear":"2026","limit":25,"offset":0}

### Owner-only school creation
POST {{base}}/v1/schools
Origin: https://APPROVED_FRONTEND_ORIGIN
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"code":"fictional-school","name":"Fictional School","timezone":"Asia/Kolkata","plan":"Pilot","startsAt":"2026-11-07T00:00:00Z","endsAt":"2027-11-07T00:00:00Z","teacherLimit":10,"studentLimit":100,"aiLimit":100}

### Sign out clears the application session
POST {{base}}/v1/auth/logout
Origin: https://APPROVED_FRONTEND_ORIGIN
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

# Complete operation request schemas are in openapi.json. This sample collection
# does not yet exercise every group/import/query/profile/owner workflow end-to-end.
